#: 3797667fe5264519b1dc5a3f6677ed26
msgid ""
"HamGNN 当前的 checkpoint 不包含配置信息，因为 Model.py 中的 "
"``self.save_hyperparameters()`` 被注释掉了。未来应该启用该功能， 这样就可以像 nequip 一样直接从 "
"checkpoint 编译，而不需要额外的配置文件。 参见: `HamGNN_v_2_0/models/Model.py:100 "
"<https://github.com/bud-"
"primordium/HamGNN/blob/313af4fe09d36b55ec17d9fa7eea143c565465b1/HamGNN_v_2_0/models/Model.py#L100>`_"
msgstr ""
"Currently, HamGNN checkpoints do not include configuration information because ``self.save_hyperparameters()`` in Model.py is commented out. This feature should be enabled in the future to allow direct compilation from checkpoints, similar to nequip, without needing an extra configuration file. See: `HamGNN_v_2_0/models/Model.py:100 "
"<https://github.com/bud-"
"primordium/HamGNN/blob/313af4fe09d36b55ec17d9fa7eea143c565465b1/HamGNN_v_2_0/models/Model.py#L100>`_"

